{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17079","headline":"夏夜北园即事寄门下武相公 · 李吉甫","name":"夏夜北园即事寄门下武相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结构非华宇，登临似古原。\n僻殊萧相宅，芜胜邵平园。\n避暑依南庑，追凉在北轩。\n烟霞霄外静，草露月中繁。\n鹊绕惊还止，虫吟思不喧。\n怀君欲有赠，宿昔贵忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李吉甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}